                                    <div class="home-card-stat-label">已发布模型</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="home-card-info">
                                最新优化模型支持MTK 9300/H0871芯片组，推理速度提升30%
                            </div>
                            <div class="home-card-tags">
                                <span class="tag">MTK 9300</span>
                                <span class="tag">MTK H0871</span>
                                <span class="tag">高通骁龙8系列</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="home-card-footer">
                            <button class="btn">进入模型市场</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="home-card">
                        <div class="home-card-header">
                            <div class="home-card-title">大模型推理</div>
                            <div class="home-card-subtitle">本地部署</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="home-card-content">
                            <div class="home-card-info">
                                QWen2.5-7B / QWen2.5-1.8B 大语言模型，支持多轮对话
                            </div>
                            <div class="home-card-tags">
                                <span class="tag">MTK 9300</span>
                                <span class="tag">高通骁龙8系列</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="home-card-footer">
                            <button class="btn">开始对话</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 底部导航 -->
                <div class="bottom-nav">
                    <div class="nav-item active">
                        <div class="icon">🏠</div>
                        <div>首页</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="nav-item">
                        <div class="icon">🧪</div>
                        <div>测试</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 模型市场 -->
        <div class="page-section">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span>模型市场</span>
            </div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <!-- 状态栏 -->
                <div class="status-bar">
                    <div>17:21</div>
                    <div>
                        <span>📶</span>
                        <span>🔋</span>
                        <span>⚙️</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 头部导航 -->
                <div class="header">
                    <div class="back-icon">◀</div>
                    <div class="title">模型市场</div>
                    <div class="action-icon">💬</div>
                </div>

                <!-- 模型市场内容 -->
                <div class="text-center mb-16 mt-16">
                    <h2>模型应用分类</h2>
                    <p>已发布28个模型，覆盖多种应用场景，支持复杂AI任务</p>
                </div>

                <div class="model-grid">
                    <!-- 目标检测卡片 -->
